<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2015/Back-Yard.jpg" alt="Plein air painting in the back yard" width="450" height="350" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">No Edges in the Sky. 8x10, oil on linen panel. 2015</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">What a great day to be painting outside! Standing in the shade of a pine tree this afternoon I could only hear the sound of birds and someone in the far distance mowing their yard.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The spring greens have arrived in full force and, as usual, it takes everything I have not to let the painting be overwhelmed by them.</p>